Wait, let\'s count the essential prime implicants:
EPIs: \$\\bar{C}\$ (covers 8 minterms), \$B \\bar{D}\$ (covers \$m(14)\$), \$\\bar{A} \\bar{D}\$ (covers \$m(2)\$).
